<li>A single trunk ships on merge, and the log says when a way to production changes</li>
<li>A release branch into staging is still a staging release</li>
<li>Git ships a pull-only crate only once it has listed it</li>
<li>Into production from anything but staging is a hotfix</li>
<li>A bot's crate the station only saw merged leaves storage</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
